# Product layer

When this repo has `CONSTITUTION.md` or `docs/features/`:

1. Read `CONSTITUTION.md` before planning or editing.
2. If the user or spine payload names `feature_spec`, read that file and treat acceptance criteria as the definition of done.
3. Do not mark work complete until spec test plan commands pass.
4. Call `store_memory` at task end for binding decisions.

Spine workflow: `@feature-from-spec` via `agent-spine init --with feature-from-spec`.
